<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-AJAX 1 JUVENTUS 2 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AJAX 1 JUVENTUS 2 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juventus of Italy beat Ajax Amsterdam of the Netherlands 2-1 (halftime 2-0) in their European Cup semifinal first leg on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ajax - Jari Litmanen 66</p>
<p>Juventus - Nicola Amoruso 14, Christian Vieri 41</p>
